    <string name="vc_whatsapp_title">Import from WhatsApp</string>
    <string name="vc_whatsapp_steps">1. Open WhatsApp and go to the chat with the .scx file.\n2. Press and hold the file, then tap Share (under ⋮ at the top if you don’t see it).\n3. Choose VPN Connect. The connection is imported straight away.\n\nOr tap the file in the chat and choose VPN Connect to open it.</string>
