    <string name="vc_help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="vc_help_body">1. Open the ⋮ menu, tap “Import connection” and choose your .scx file. If it came by WhatsApp, pick “From WhatsApp” there for the steps, or “Browse WhatsApp Documents” to pick it from WhatsApp’s folder.\n2. Select the connection, tap Connect, allow the VPN prompt, then sign in with your user name and password.\n3. Tap Disconnect when you are done.\n\nIf something fails, open the VPN log from the ⋮ menu and send it to ICT support.</string>
    <string name="vc_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="vc_about_body">VPN Connect connects to IPsec VPNs on Sophos Firewall, using the Sophos Connect (.scx) file you import.\n\nVPN engine: strongSwan, licensed under GPLv2. This app is distributed under the same licence.\n\nAuthor: zero.cyfa</string>

